# http://rdf.geohistoricaldata.org/id/codes/cadastre/plotNature/Noyer
<http://rdf.geohistoricaldata.org/id/codes/cadastre/plotNature/Noyer> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
